# Pac-Man Game (Python)
This project is a grid-based Pac-Man game developed using Python and the pygame library as part of the Algorithm and Programming final project.

## Features
- Object-Oriented design (PacMan and Ghost classes)
- Grid-based movement and collision detection
- Multiple game states (Start, Playing, Win, Game Over)
- Scoring system and lives mechanic

## How to Run
1. Install pygame
   pip install pygame
2. Run the game
   python main.py

## Documentation
Full project documentation and poster can be found in the `docs/` and `poster/` folders.

